# FLOW_JOURNAL Incident 86, SEC gate: the FINAL netlist of final_B
# (runs/final_B/54-openroad-fillinsertion/soc_asic_top.nl.v) read exactly as EQY's gate side
# (sky130 formal cell models, flatten, hide non-RTL names), then the EQY [script] tail up to
# memory_map. Async resets are kept as $adff here; the miter maps them.
script gate_front_end_R14FB.ys
hierarchy -top soc_asic_top
proc
prep -top soc_asic_top -flatten
memory -nomap
memory_map
opt_clean
check -assert -initdrv
write_ilang gate_pre_R14FB.il
